{"agent":"bg99","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"`_branch_ahead` documents a three-way result (ahead, absent/merged, or unknown) but after `probe.unavailable` it treats every other non-zero `rev-parse` as “ref not there” and returns 0. Git uses exit 1 for a missing ref and 128 for fatal failures (not a repository, permission, `safe.directory`, corrupt/missing git dir). Given a gone worktree whose branch `ddflow/LS-worker-lane-override` still has unmerged commits, a 128 from `git rev-parse --verify --quiet refs/heads/...` makes `_gone_tree` take the `ahead == 0` path and emit `worktree is gone; nothing to salvage`, which is the B5b1c6272c1 cleanup proposal again, not “could not be measured”.","digest":"4738bdb14bb1c897","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/services/leases/recovery.py:286","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/leases/recovery.py:286"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":8990,"diff_sha":"36039aa2f68107a94cdeaff4209288f3cd916c48219a3ea51a03869b7de4a5e1","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-B5b1c6272c1","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":149.7,"family":"xai","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"b50b9e1bef911f5e","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B5b1c6272c1.critic.grok-4.7.20261108T223938Z-22122d82.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_head":"367b9a61ebf6f10b21d2d04aca46301e801652d2","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/services/leases/recovery.py":"100644 cc1bc041598d10cbbb9b46a4c65eb492411f6ce2","tests/test_recover_merged_item.py":"100644 d2399b97e28a5de9aa4a654e80952e2ac6d0ca44"},"reviewer":"grok-4.7","reviewer_digest":"1857ec352c55ee94","reviewer_families":["xai"],"round":2,"rounds":2,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/services/leases/recovery.py:286"],"tree_sha":"367b9a6